+3.  **Axis-Angle Conversion:**
+    - $\text{AA2R}(v, \theta)$: Converts axis $v$ and angle $\theta$ to a rotation matrix.
+    - $\text{R2AA}(R)$: Converts rotation matrix $R$ to axis $v$ and angle $\theta$ [S1].
